{"id":"n69552-1-11","stage":3,"title":"원칙 · 原则","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69552-1-11-1","ko":"이 옷 조금만 할인해 주면 안될까요?","zh":"这件衣服能稍微打折吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할인해","meaning":"打折，优惠，降价","explanation":"할인하다：打折，优惠，降价；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"할인하다","audio":"/audio/dc654482dfd0e72fb91b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84248","senseId":"1","lemma":"할인하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주면","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안될까요?","meaning":"不可以吗（委婉请求）","explanation":"안：不；되다：可以、得到允许。-면 안 될까요? 字面为“不可以吗”，本句委婉请求打折。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"},{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"dc654482dfd0e72f","term":"할인하다","zh":"打折，优惠，降价","audio":"/audio/dc654482dfd0e72fb91b.mp3","entryId":"84248","definition":"从定好的价格中减掉一些。","pronunciation":["하린하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ccf5235f422615bf140.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69552-1-11-2","ko":"죄송합니다 고객님, 백화점 원칙으로 할인은 안 됩니다.","zh":"很抱歉，根据百货公司的规定，无法打折。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송합니다","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고객님,","meaning":"顾客","explanation":"고객：顾客；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"고객","audio":"/audio/e7be0e0ef539353540fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28003","senseId":"1","lemma":"고객","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"백화점","meaning":"百货商店","explanation":"백화점：百货商店","readings":[{"term":"백화점","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26844","senseId":"1","lemma":"백화점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원칙으로","meaning":"原则","explanation":"원칙：原则；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"원칙","audio":"/audio/85f7a43f82704e65ec57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69552","senseId":"1","lemma":"원칙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할인은","meaning":"打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价","explanation":"할인：打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"할인","audio":"/audio/37ccd7d822c8e4eb7b32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72464","senseId":"1","lemma":"할인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됩니다.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"e7be0e0ef5393535","term":"고객","zh":"顾客","audio":"/audio/e7be0e0ef539353540fd.mp3","entryId":"28003","definition":"购买商品或使用服务的人。","pronunciation":["고객"]},{"id":"655eab9f02534cf0","term":"백화점","zh":"百货商店","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3","entryId":"26844","definition":"在一个建筑内按照种类分区摆放和销售各种商品的大商店。","pronunciation":["배콰점"]},{"id":"85f7a43f82704e65","term":"원칙","zh":"原则","audio":"/audio/85f7a43f82704e65ec57.mp3","entryId":"69552","definition":"某行动或理论等中必须要一贯地遵守的基本性的规则或法则。","pronunciation":["원칙"]},{"id":"37ccd7d822c8e4eb","term":"할인","zh":"打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价","audio":"/audio/37ccd7d822c8e4eb7b32.mp3","entryId":"72464","definition":"从原定价格上减去一些。","pronunciation":["하린"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e01ca9c0022691d086ca.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.222,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69552","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["很抱歉，根据百货公司的规定，无法打折。","这件衣服能稍微打折吗？","最近生活过得怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这件衣服能稍微打折吗？","最近生活过得怎么样？","很抱歉，根据百货公司的规定，无法打折。"],"answer":2}]}
